    "text": "KFDM-TV\nwebsite\nChambers County, Texas\nMan arrested after allegedly running over woman and calling tow truck\nBy Zoe Holman,\n3 hours agoCHAMBERS COUNTY — A man in Chambers County is facing a murder charge after investigators allege he ran over a woman near Winnie. Instead of rendering aid to the victim, the man reportedly called a tow truck and his wife. Authorities have not released further details about the incident...",
